# Architecture

Always follow:

- Clean Architecture
- Hexagonal Architecture
- Domain Driven Design
- SOLID
- Ports and Adapters

Rules:

- Domain never depends on Infrastructure.
- Business logic belongs only in Domain.
- Infrastructure implements Ports.
- Delivery contains no business logic.
- Frameworks are implementation details.
- Database is an implementation detail.
- LLMs are implementation details.
- Protect the business domain above all else.